---
fileType: Question Text
version: CSPro 8.1
languages:
  - name: EN
    label: English
  - name: ES
    label: Español
styles:
  - name: Qtxt
    className: Qtxt
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-size: 26px;color: #000000;
  - name: Qnum
    className: Qnum
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-weight: bold;font-size: 26px;color: #000000;
  - name: Itxt
    className: Itxt
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-style: italic;font-size: 26px;color: #0000ff;
  - name: Inum
    className: Inum
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;font-size: 26px;color: #0000ff;
  - name: QtxtC
    className: QtxtC
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-size: 26px;color: #ff0000;
  - name: QnumC
    className: QnumC
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-weight: bold;font-size: 26px;color: #ff0000;
  - name: ItxtC
    className: ItxtC
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-style: italic;font-size: 26px;color: #ff0000;
  - name: InumC
    className: InumC
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;font-size: 26px;color: #ff0000;
  - name: REF
    className: REF
    css: |
      font-family: Courier New;font-style: italic;font-size: 26px;color: #000000;
questions:
  - name: MICS7FS.FS9
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">FS9. </span><span class="Itxt">Check completed questionnaires in this household: Have you or another member of your team interviewed this respondent for another questionnaire?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">FS9. </span><span class="Itxt">Marque los cuestionarios completados en este hogar: ¿Usted u otro miembro de su equipo ha entrevistado a este encuestado para otro cuestionario?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FS10
    conditions:
      - logic: FS9=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FS10B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to talk to you about <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>'s health and well-being in more detail.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">This interview usually takes about <span class="QtxtC">number </span>minutes.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Again, participation in this survey is voluntary. No payment of incentive will be given to you for answering these questions. However, this survey will help the government and the general public better understand the situation and needs of children and adolescents.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Please know that all the information you share during the interview will remain strictly confidential and anonymous. No information about you or your child will be made publicly available. We will only produce information about the general population.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Again, should you wish not to answer a question or wish to stop the interview at any point, please let me know.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">If at any time you have any complaints or concerns about this survey, please use the information on the card I gave you earlier to contact <span class="QtxtC">organisation name</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">May I start the interview?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FS10B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría hablarte sobre la salud y el bienestar de <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> con más detalle.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Esta entrevista suele durar unos <span class="QtxtC">números </span>minutos.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Nuevamente, la participación en esta encuesta es voluntaria. No se le otorgará ningún pago de incentivo por responder estas preguntas. Sin embargo, esta encuesta ayudará al gobierno y al público en general a comprender mejor la situación y las necesidades de los niños y adolescentes.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Tenga en cuenta que toda la información que comparta durante la entrevista será estrictamente confidencial y anónima. Ninguna información sobre usted o su hijo se hará pública. Sólo produciremos información sobre la población general.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Nuevamente, si no desea responder una pregunta o desea detener la entrevista en algún momento, hágamelo saber.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Si en algún momento tiene alguna queja o inquietud sobre esta encuesta, utilice la información de la tarjeta que le di anteriormente para comunicarse con <span class="QtxtC">nombre de la organización</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Puedo comenzar la entrevista?</span></p>
      - logic: FS9=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FS10A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Hello, my name is <span class="REF">~~STAFF_NAME~~</span>. We are from <span class="QtxtC">National Statistical Office</span>. We are conducting a survey about the situation of children, families and households. I would like to talk to you about <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>'s health and well-being.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">This interview usually takes about <span class="QtxtC">number </span>minutes.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Participation in this survey is voluntary. No payment or incentive will be given to you or your family members for answering these questions. However, the information gathered will be very helpful for the government and the general public to better understand the situation and needs of children and adolescents.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Please know that all the information you share during the interview will remain strictly confidential and anonymous. No information about you or your child will be made publicly available. We will only be producing information about the general population.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Should you feel uncomfortable about any questions and not wish to answer, just let me know and we can skip the question. Also, if you wish to stop the interview at any point just let me know.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">If at any time you have any complaints or concerns about this survey, please use the information provided on this card to contact <span class="QtxtC">organisation name</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">May I start the interview?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FS10A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Hola, mi nombre es <span class="REF">~~STAFF_NAME~~</span>. Somos de la <span class="QtxtC">Oficina Nacional de Estadística</span>. Estamos realizando una encuesta sobre la situación de los niños, las familias y los hogares. Me gustaría hablar contigo sobre la salud y el bienestar de <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Esta entrevista suele durar unos <span class="QtxtC">números </span>minutos.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">La participación en esta encuesta es voluntaria. No se le otorgará ningún pago ni incentivo a usted ni a los miembros de su familia por responder estas preguntas. Sin embargo, la información recopilada será de gran ayuda para que el gobierno y el público en general comprendan mejor la situación y las necesidades de los niños y adolescentes.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Tenga en cuenta que toda la información que comparta durante la entrevista será estrictamente confidencial y anónima. Ninguna información sobre usted o su hijo se hará pública. Sólo produciremos información sobre la población en general.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Si se siente incómodo con alguna pregunta y no desea responder, hágamelo saber y podremos omitir la pregunta. Además, si deseas detener la entrevista en algún momento, házmelo saber.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Si en algún momento tiene alguna queja o inquietud sobre esta encuesta, utilice la información proporcionada en esta tarjeta para comunicarse con <span class="QtxtC">nombre de la organización</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Puedo comenzar la entrevista?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.CB0B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB0B. </span><span class="Qtxt">What is your relationship to <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB0B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuál es su relación con <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: CB2DATE
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB2. </span><span class="Qtxt">On what day, month and year was was <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> born?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">What is his birthday?</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB2.</span><span class="Qtxt">¿En qué día, mes y año nació<span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>&nbsp;?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Sonda:</span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuál es su cumpleaños?</span></p><p></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB2. </span><span class="Qtxt">On what day, month and year was <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> born?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">What is her birthday?</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB2.&nbsp;</span><span class="Qtxt">¿En qué día, mes y año nació<span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Sonda:</span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuál es ella? cumpleaños?</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.CB2D
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">If the mother/caregiver knows the exact date of birth, also record the day; otherwise, record '98' for day.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Si la madre/cuidador sabe la fecha exacta de nacimiento, registre también el día; de lo contrario, registre '98' para el día.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">If the mother/caregiver knows the exact date of birth, also record the day; otherwise, record '98' for day.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Si la madre/cuidador sabe la fecha exacta de nacimiento, registre también el día; de lo contrario, registre '98' para el día.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.CB2M
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Record month.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Mes de registro.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Record month.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Mes de registro.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.CB2Y
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Record year.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Año récord.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Record year.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Año récord.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.CB3
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB3. </span><span class="Qtxt">How old is <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">How old was <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> at his last birthday?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record age in completed years.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If responses to CB2 and CB3 are inconsistent, probe further and correct.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB3. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántos años tiene <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sonda: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántos años tenía <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> en su último cumpleaños?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro de edad en años cumplidos.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si las respuestas a CB2 y CB3 son inconsistentes, indague más y corrija.</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB3. </span><span class="Qtxt">How old is <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">How old was <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> at her last birthday?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record age in completed years.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If responses to CB2 and CB3 are inconsistent, probe further and correct.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB3. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántos años tiene <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sonda: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántos años tenía <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> en su último cumpleaños?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro de edad en años cumplidos.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si las respuestas a CB2 y CB3 son inconsistentes, indague más y corrija.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.CB5
    conditions:
      - logic: ED5A(FS3)>=8
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB5A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> ever attend any <span class="QtxtC">Early Childhood Education Programme</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB5A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Asistió <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> alguna vez a algún <span class="QtxtC">Programa de Educación Infantil</span>?</span></p>
      - logic: ED5A(FS3)>=1 and ED5A(FS3)<=4
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB5B. </span><span class="Qtxt">According to the information I have, the highest level of education <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> has ever attended is ~~getvaluelabel(ED5A(FS3))~~.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> ever attend any <span class="QtxtC">Early Childhood Education Programme</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CB5B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Según la información que tengo, el nivel más alto de educación al que <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> ha asistido es ~~getvaluelabel(ED5A(FS3))~~.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Asistió <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> alguna vez a algún <span class="QtxtC">Programa de Educación Infantil</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FIN1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FIN1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Is <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> covered by any health insurance?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FIN1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Está <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> cubierto por algún seguro médico?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FIN2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FIN2. </span><span class="Qtxt">What type of health insurance is <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> covered by?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record all mentioned.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FIN2. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué tipo de seguro médico cubre <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registra todo lo mencionado.</span></p>
  - name: CL1
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CL1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to ask about any work <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> may do.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Since last <span class="REF">~~daystring~~</span>, did <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> do any of the following activities, even for only one hour?</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CL1.</span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría preguntar sobre cualquier trabajo que <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>&nbsp;pueda realizar.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Desde el último <span class="REF">~~daystring~~</span>, ¿Hizo <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> alguna de las siguientes actividades, aunque fuera solo durante una hora?</span></p><p></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CL1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to ask about any work <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> may do.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Since last <span class="REF">~~daystring~~</span>, did <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> do any of the following activities, even for only one hour?</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CL1.</span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría preguntar sobre cualquier trabajo que <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>&nbsp;pueda realizar.</span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">Desde el último <span class="REF">~~daystring~~</span>, ¿Hizo <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> alguna de las siguientes actividades, aunque fuera solo durante una hora?</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.CL1A
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> do any work or help on his own or the household's plot, farm, food garden or looked after animals? For example, growing farm produce, harvesting, or feeding, grazing, or milking animals?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Hizo <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> algún trabajo o ayudó en su propia parcela, granja, huerto o cuidó animales? Por ejemplo, ¿cultivar productos agrícolas, cosechar, alimentar, pastorear u ordeñar animales?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> do any work or help on her own or the household's plot, farm, food garden or looked after animals? For example, growing farm produce, harvesting, or feeding, grazing, or milking animals?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Hizo <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> algún trabajo o ayudó por su cuenta o en la parcela, granja, huerto o cuidó animales del hogar? Por ejemplo, ¿cultivar productos agrícolas, cosechar, alimentar, pastorear u ordeñar animales?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.CL1B
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> help in a family business or a relative's business with or without pay, or run his own business?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ayudó <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> en un negocio familiar o en el negocio de un familiar con o sin remuneración, o dirigió su propio negocio?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> help in a family business or a relative's business with or without pay, or run her own business?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ayudó <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> en un negocio familiar o en el negocio de un familiar con o sin remuneración, o dirigió su propio negocio?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.CL1C
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">Did <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> produce or sell articles, handicrafts, clothes, food, or agricultural products?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Produjo o vendió <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> artículos, artesanías, ropa, alimentos o productos agrícolas?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.CL1X
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[X] </span><span class="Qtxt">DId <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> engage in any <u>other</u> activity in return for income in cash or in kind, even for only one  hour?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[X] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Participó <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> en alguna <u>otra</u> actividad a cambio de ingresos en efectivo o en especie, aunque solo fuera por una hora?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.CL3
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CL3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Since last <span class="REF">~~daystring~~,</span> about how many hours did <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> engage in (this activity/these activities), in total?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one hour, record '00'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CL3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Desde el último <span class="REF">~~daystring~~,</span>&nbsp;¿aproximadamente cuántas horas participó <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> (esta actividad/estas actividades), en total?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de una hora, registre '00'.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.CL4
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CL4. </span><span class="Qtxt">(Does the activity/Do these activities) require carrying heavy loads?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CL4. </span><span class="Qtxt">(¿La actividad/Estas actividades) requieren transportar cargas pesadas?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.CL5
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
