              <span class="Qnum">FCF8A. </span><span class="Qtxt">When using her hearing aid(s), does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> have difficulty hearing sounds like people's voices or music?</span><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <span class="Qnum">FCF8A.</span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando usa su(s) audífono(s), ¿<span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>&nbsp;tiene dificultad para escuchar sonidos como las voces de las personas o la música?</span><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FCF10
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Without his equipment or assistance, does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> have difficulty walking 100 <span class="QtxtC">meters/yard </span> on level ground?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">That would be about the length of <span class="QtxtC">1 football field</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Note that category 'No difficulty' is not available, as the child uses equipment or receives assistance for walking.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Sin su equipo o asistencia, ¿<span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> tiene dificultades para caminar 100 <span class="QtxtC">metros/yarda</span> en terreno llano?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sonda: </span><span class="Qtxt">Eso sería aproximadamente la longitud de <span class="QtxtC">1 campo de fútbol</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Tenga en cuenta que la categoría 'Sin dificultad' no está disponible, ya que el niño utiliza equipo o recibe ayuda para caminar.</span></p>
