            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF16. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tiene <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> dificultades con el cuidado personal, como alimentarse o vestirse?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FCF17
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF17. </span><span class="Qtxt">When <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> speaks, does he have difficulty being understood by people inside of this household?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF17. </span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> habla, ¿tiene dificultades para ser entendido por las personas dentro de este hogar?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF17. </span><span class="Qtxt">When <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> speaks, does she have difficulty being understood by people inside of this household?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF17. </span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> habla, ¿tiene dificultades para ser entendida por las personas dentro de este hogar?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FCF18
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF18. </span><span class="Qtxt">When <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> speaks, does he have difficulty being understood by people outside of this household?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF18. </span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> habla, ¿tiene dificultades para ser entendido por personas ajenas a este hogar?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF18. </span><span class="Qtxt">When <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> speaks, does she have difficulty being understood by people outside of this household?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF18. </span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> habla, ¿tiene dificultades para ser entendida por personas ajenas a este hogar?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FCF19
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF19. </span><span class="Qtxt">Compared with children of the same age, does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> have difficulty learning things?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF19. </span><span class="Qtxt">En comparación con niños de la misma edad, ¿<span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> tiene dificultades para aprender cosas?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FCF20
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF20. </span><span class="Qtxt">Compared with children of the same age, does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> have difficulty remembering things?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF20. </span><span class="Qtxt">En comparación con niños de la misma edad, ¿<span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> tiene dificultades para recordar cosas?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FCF21
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF21. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> have difficulty concentrating on an activity that he enjoys doing?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF21. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tiene <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> dificultades para concentrarse en una actividad que le gusta hacer?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF21. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> have difficulty concentrating on an activity that she enjoys doing?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF21. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tiene <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> dificultades para concentrarse en una actividad que le gusta hacer?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FCF22
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF22. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> have difficulty accepting changes in his routine?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF22. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tiene <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> dificultades para aceptar cambios en su rutina?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF22. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> have difficulty accepting changes in her routine?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF22. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tiene <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> dificultades para aceptar cambios en su rutina?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FCF23
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF23. </span><span class="Qtxt">Compared with children of the same age, does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> have difficulty controlling his behaviour?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF23. </span><span class="Qtxt">En comparación con niños de la misma edad, ¿<span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> tiene dificultades para controlar su comportamiento?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF23. </span><span class="Qtxt">Compared with children of the same age, does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> have difficulty controlling her behaviour?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF23. </span><span class="Qtxt">En comparación con niños de la misma edad, ¿<span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> tiene dificultades para controlar su comportamiento?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FCF24
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF24. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> have difficulty making friends?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF24. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tiene <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> dificultades para hacer amigos?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FCF25
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF25. </span><span class="Qtxt">The next questions have different options for answers. I am going to read these to you after each question.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">I would like to know how often <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> seems very anxious, nervous or worried.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Would you say: daily, weekly, monthly, a few times a year or never?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF25. </span><span class="Qtxt">Las siguientes preguntas tienen diferentes opciones de respuesta. Voy a leerlas después de cada pregunta.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Me gustaría saber con qué frecuencia <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> parece muy ansioso, nervioso o preocupado.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Dirías: diariamente, semanalmente, mensualmente, algunas veces al año o nunca?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FCF26
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF26. </span><span class="Qtxt">I would also like to know how often <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> seems very sad or depressed.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Would you say: daily, weekly, monthly, a few times a year or never?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FCF26. </span><span class="Qtxt">También me gustaría saber con qué frecuencia <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> parece muy triste o deprimido.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Dirías: diariamente, semanalmente, mensualmente, algunas veces al año o nunca?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU3
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt"><span class="Inum">FTU2. </span>Begin by asking the respondent what time the child woke up the day before the interview and what time the child went to sleep. Then ask to list the activities the child did during the day in chronological order. For each activity, record the appropriate code in FTU7, ask FTU8-FTU10 and, if applicable, proceed to ask any follow-up questions. After recording all information relative to an activity, you will be led back to FTU7 to ask what the child did next. Once respondent mentions the child went to sleep for the night, do not record anything else. Finally, to ensure everything the child did yesterday has been captured, FTU18 will prompt you to read all activities recorded and ask if anything is missing. If yes, enter the code, time and/or duration for each activity that was not previously mentioned or captured.</span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU3.</span> I will now ask you about what ~~FS3A~~ did yesterday, between waking up in the morning and going to bed at night for sleeping. You can include anything ~~FS3A~~ did. These can include active tasks such as studying and eating or passive activities such as relaxing or thinking.</p><div><br/></div><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt"><span class="Inum">FTU2. </span>Comience preguntando al encuestado a qué hora se despertó el niño el día antes de la entrevista y a qué hora se fue a dormir. Luego pida que enumere las actividades que realizó el niño durante el día en orden cronológico. Para cada actividad, registrar el código correspondiente en FTU7, preguntar FTU8-FTU10 y, en su caso, proceder a realizar las preguntas de seguimiento. Después de registrar toda la información relativa a una actividad, regresará a FTU7 para preguntar qué hizo el niño a continuación. Una vez que el encuestado mencione que el niño se fue a dormir por la noche, no registre nada más. Finalmente, para garantizar que se haya capturado todo lo que hizo el niño ayer, FTU18 le pedirá que lea todas las actividades registradas y le preguntará si falta algo. En caso afirmativo, ingrese el código, hora y/o duración de cada actividad que no se mencionó ni capturó anteriormente.</span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU3.</span> Ahora le preguntaré qué hizo ~~FS3A~~ ayer, entre despertarse por la mañana y acostarse por la noche para dormir. Puede incluir cualquier cosa que haya hecho ~~FS3A~~. Estas pueden incluir tareas activas como estudiar y comer o actividades pasivas como relajarse o pensar.</p><div><br/></div><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU4
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <b>FTU4.</b> What time did ~~FS3A~~ wake up yesterday?<br/><span class="Itxt">record as HH.MM</span><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <b>FTU4.</b>&nbsp;¿A qué hora se despertó ~~FS3A~~ ayer?<br/><span class="Itxt">registrar como HH.MM</span><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU5
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <span class="Qnum">FTU5. </span>What time did ~~FS3A~~ go to sleep for the night yesterday?<br/><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">record as HH.MM</span><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <span class="Qnum">FTU5.</span>¿A qué hora se fue a dormir ~~FS3A~~ ayer?<br/><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">registrar como HH.MM</span><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU7
    conditions:
      - logic: FTU6 = 1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><b><i>First activity starting at ~~stactiv~~ </i></b><b><br/></b></p><p><b>FTU7. </b>What did ~~FS3A~~ do first?</p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><b><i>Primera actividad que comienza en ~~stactiv~~</i></b><b><br/></b></p><p><b>FTU7.&nbsp;</b>¿Qué hizo ~~FS3A~~ primero?</p><p></p>
      - logic: FTU6 > 1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><b><i>Activity ~~FTU6~~ starting at ~~stactiv~~ </i></b><b><br/></b></p><p><b>FTU7. </b>What did ~~FS3A~~ do next? </p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><b><i>Actividad ~~FTU6~~ comenzando en ~~stactiv~~</i></b><b><br/></b></p><p><b>FTU7.</b>¿Qué hizo a continuación ~~FS3A~~?</p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU9X
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Activity ~~FTU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU9.- </span><span class="Qnum">FTU10.</span> <span class="Qnum"> </span>How long did ~~FS3A~~ do this activity? What time did this activity end?</p><p><span class="Itxt">Select response type</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Actividad ~~FTU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~ : ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU9.-&nbsp;</span><span class="Qnum">FTU10.</span>&nbsp;<span class="Qnum">&nbsp;</span>Cuánto tiempo ¿~~FS3A~~ realizó esta actividad? ¿A qué hora terminó esta actividad?</p><p><span class="Itxt">Seleccione tipo de respuesta</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU9
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Activity ~~FTU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Itxt"><span class="Inum"></span></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU9</span><span class="Qnum">.</span> <span class="Qnum"> </span>How long did ~~FS3A~~ do this activity? </p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Record as HH.MM</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Actividad ~~FTU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~ : ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Itxt"><span class="Inum"></span></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU9</span><span class="Qnum">.</span>&nbsp;<span class="Qnum">&nbsp;</span>¿Durante cuánto tiempo&nbsp;~~FS3A~~&nbsp;realizó esta actividad?</p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Registrar como HH.MM</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU10
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Activity ~~FTU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><span class="Qnum">FTU10. </span>What time did this activity end?<p></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Record as HH.MM</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Actividad ~~FTU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~ : ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><span class="Qnum">FTU10.&nbsp;</span>¿A qué hora terminó esta actividad?<p></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Registrar como HH.MM</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU12
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Activity ~~FTU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU12.</span> Did ~~FS3A~~ play online?</p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Actividad ~~FTU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU12.</span>&nbsp;¿~~FS3A~~&nbsp;jugó en línea?</p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU13
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Activity ~~FTU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU13. </span>With whom did ~~FS3A~~ play?</p><p><span class="Itxt">Probe: <span class="Qtxt">Anyone else?</span></span><br/></p><p><span class="Itxt">Record all mentioned. Do not record C, D if FTU12=2</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Actividad ~~FTU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~ : ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU13.&nbsp;</span>¿Con quién jugó ~~FS3A~~?</p><p><span class="Itxt">Sondeo:&nbsp;<span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien más?</span></span><br/></p><p><span class="Itxt">Registra todo lo mencionado. No registrar C, D si FTU12=2</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU14
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Activity ~~FTU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU14.</span> Did ~~FS3A~~ watch this online?</p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Actividad ~~FTU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU14.</span>&nbsp;¿~~FS3A~~&nbsp;vio esto en línea?</p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU15
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p></p><div><p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Activity ~~FTU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU15.</span> Did ~~FS3A~~ get the news online?</p></div>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p></p><div><p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Actividad ~~FTU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU15.</span>&nbsp;¿~~FS3A~~&nbsp;recibió las noticias en línea?</p></div>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU16
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Activity ~~FTU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU16. </span>Did ~~FS3A~~ engage in this activity or do this activity online?</p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Actividad ~~FTU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU16.&nbsp;</span>¿~~FS3A~~&nbsp;participó en esta actividad o realizó esta actividad en línea?</p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU17
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Activity ~~FTU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><b><i> </i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU17. </span>How were ~~FS3A~~'s lessons delivered?</p><p><span class="Itxt">Record all mentioned. Probe:</span> Anything else?</p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum"><b><i>Actividad ~~FTU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~FTU7A~~</i></b><b><i></i></b><br/></span></p><p><span class="Qnum">FTU17.</span>¿Cómo se impartieron las lecciones de ~~FS3A~~?</p><p><span class="Itxt">Registrar todo lo mencionado. Indague:</span>&nbsp;¿Algo más?</p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FTU18
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><b>FTU18. </b>Just to make sure I have this right I will now repeat all the activities ~~FS3A~~ have listed in chronological order. I would like you to think if there is any activity ~~FS3A~~ did yesterday, between waking up in the morning and going to bed at night for sleeping, that you forgot to mention.</p><p><span class="Itxt">Read aloud the list of activities reported and ask: </span>  <br/></p><p>Did ~~FS3A~~ do anything else that we have not recorded yet?</p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><b>FTU18.&nbsp;</b>Solo para asegurarme de que tengo esto correcto, ahora repetiré todas las actividades&nbsp;~~FS3A~~&nbsp;enumeradas en orden cronológico. Me gustaría que pensaras si hay alguna actividad que ~~FS3A~~ realizó ayer, entre despertarte por la mañana y acostarte por la noche para dormir, que olvidaste mencionar.</p><p><span class="Itxt">Lee en voz alta la lista de actividades reportadas y pregunte:&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br/></p><p>¿~~FS3A~~&nbsp;hizo algo más que no hayamos grabado todavía?</p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.PR3
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I am going to ask you a few more questions about <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>'s school and homework.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Once you have answered those questions, I would like to speak to <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>. If he is at home right now, can you please ask him to stay around? If he is not at home right now, could you please arrange for him to return home now? If it is not possible for him to return home, please let me know when a convenient time for me would be to come back and talk to <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">We can discuss this at the end of the interview.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Excluding school text books and holy books, how many books do you have for <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> to read at home?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora voy a hacerte algunas preguntas más sobre la escuela y las tareas de <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Una vez que haya respondido esas preguntas, me gustaría hablar con <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>. Si está en casa ahora mismo, ¿podrías pedirle que se quede? Si no está en casa en este momento, ¿podría hacer arreglos para que regrese a casa ahora? Si no le es posible regresar a casa, avíseme cuando sea un momento conveniente para mí regresar y hablar con <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Podemos discutir esto al final de la entrevista.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Excluyendo los libros de texto escolares y los libros sagrados, ¿cuántos libros tienes para que <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> los lea en casa?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I am going to ask you a few more questions about <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>'s school and homework.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Once you have answered those questions, I would like to speak to <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>. If she is at home right now, can you please ask her to stay around? If she is not at home right now, could you please arrange for her to return home now? If it is not possible for her to return home, please let me know when a convenient time for me would be to come back and talk to <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">We can discuss this at the end of the interview.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Excluding school text books and holy books, how many books do you have for <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> to read at home?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora voy a hacerte algunas preguntas más sobre la escuela y las tareas de <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Una vez que haya respondido esas preguntas, me gustaría hablar con <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>. Si ella está en casa ahora mismo, ¿podrías pedirle que se quede? Si ella no está en casa en este momento, ¿podría hacer arreglos para que regrese a casa ahora? Si no le es posible regresar a casa, avíseme cuando sea un momento conveniente para mí regresar y hablar con <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Podemos discutir esto al final de la entrevista.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Excluyendo los libros de texto escolares y los libros sagrados, ¿cuántos libros tienes para que <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> los lea en casa?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.PR5
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR5. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> ever have homework?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR5. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tiene <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> tarea alguna vez?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.PR6
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR6. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does anyone help <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> with homework?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR6. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien ayuda a <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> con la tarea?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.PR7
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR7. </span><span class="Qtxt">In the last 12 months, have you or any other adult from your household received a <span class="QtxtC">student report card</span> for <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR7. </span><span class="Qtxt">En los últimos 12 meses, ¿usted o algún otro adulto de su hogar recibió una <span class="QtxtC">boleta de calificaciones estudiantil</span> para <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.PR8
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR8. </span><span class="Qtxt">In the last 12 months, have you or any adult from your household discussed <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>’s progress with his teachers?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR8. </span><span class="Qtxt">En los últimos 12 meses, ¿usted o algún adulto de su hogar ha discutido el progreso de <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> con sus maestros?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR8. </span><span class="Qtxt">In the last 12 months, have you or any adult from your household discussed <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>’s progress with her teachers?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR8. </span><span class="Qtxt">En los últimos 12 meses, ¿usted o algún adulto de su hogar ha discutido el progreso de <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> con sus maestros?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.PR9
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR9. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>'s school have a school governing body in which parents can participate such as <span class="QtxtC">parent teacher association</span> or <span class="QtxtC">school management committee</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR9. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tiene la escuela <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> un órgano de gobierno escolar en el que los padres puedan participar, como la <span class="QtxtC">asociación de padres y maestros</span> o el <span class="QtxtC">comité de gestión escolar</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.PR10
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR10. </span><span class="Qtxt">In the last 12 months, have you or any other adult from your household attended a meeting called by this school governing body?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR10. </span><span class="Qtxt">En los últimos 12 meses, ¿ha asistido usted o algún otro adulto de su hogar a una reunión convocada por el órgano rector de esta escuela?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.PR11
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR11. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>’s school publish school report cards?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">A school report card provides information on how the school is doing, for example, information about school finance, student achievement, teacher qualifications, and other information</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PR11. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿La escuela de <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> publica boletas de calificaciones escolares?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sonda: </span><span class="Qtxt">Un boletín de calificaciones escolar proporciona información sobre el desempeño de la escuela, por ejemplo, información sobre finanzas escolares, logros de los estudiantes, calificaciones de los docentes y otra información</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FL1
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Thank you very much for answering my questions. As I mentioned earlier in this interview, now I would like to talk to <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>. I will ask him a few questions about himself, his reading habits, and the language his teachers use at school. Then, I will ask <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> if he wants to complete a few reading and number activities.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">This will take about 20 minutes.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">If you agree, I will ask <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> if he wants to participate. Participation in this activity is voluntary, and there will be no payment or incentive given to you or to your child for answering these questions. However, we are interviewing many children as part of this survey, and <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>’s participation and that of other children like him will help us understand how well children in this country are learning to read and to use numbers. This will help the government improve education.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Please know that this is not a school test and I am not trained to tell you or your child how well he did.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">All the information your child shares with us during the interview will remain strictly confidential and anonymous. No information about your child will be made publicly available. The results will not be shared with anyone, including other parents or his school.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">May I talk to <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Muchas gracias por responder mis preguntas. Como mencioné anteriormente en esta entrevista, ahora me gustaría hablar con <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>. Le haré algunas preguntas sobre él mismo, sus hábitos de lectura y el lenguaje que usan sus profesores en la escuela. Luego, le preguntaré a <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> si quiere completar algunas actividades de lectura y números.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Esto tardará unos 20 minutos.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Si estás de acuerdo, le preguntaré a <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> si quiere participar. La participación en esta actividad es voluntaria y no se le otorgará ningún pago ni incentivo a usted ni a su hijo por responder estas preguntas. Sin embargo, estamos entrevistando a muchos niños como parte de esta encuesta, y la participación de <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> y la de otros niños como él nos ayudará a comprender qué tan bien están aprendiendo los niños de este país a leer y usar los números. Esto ayudará al gobierno a mejorar la educación.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Tenga en cuenta que este no es un examen escolar y que no estoy capacitado para decirle a usted ni a su hijo qué tan bien lo hizo.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Toda la información que su hijo comparta con nosotros durante la entrevista permanecerá estrictamente confidencial y anónima. Ninguna información sobre su hijo se pondrá a disposición del público. Los resultados no se compartirán con nadie, incluidos otros padres o su escuela.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Puedo hablar con <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Thank you very much for answering my questions. As I mentioned earlier in this interview, now I would like to talk to <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>. I will ask her a few questions about herself, her reading habits, and the language her teachers use at school. Then, I will ask <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> if she wants to complete a few reading and number activities.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">This will take about 20 minutes.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">If you agree, I will ask <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> if she wants to participate. Participation in this activity is voluntary, and there will be no payment or incentive given to you or to your child for answering these questions. However, we are interviewing many children as part of this survey, and <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>’s participation and that of other children like her will help us understand how well children in this country are learning to read and to use numbers. This will help the government improve education.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Please know that this is not a school test and I am not trained to tell you or your child how well she did.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">All the information your child shares with us during the interview will remain strictly confidential and anonymous. No information about your child will be made publicly available. The results will not be shared with anyone, including other parents or her school.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">May I talk to <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Muchas gracias por responder mis preguntas. Como mencioné anteriormente en esta entrevista, ahora me gustaría hablar con <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>. Le haré algunas preguntas sobre ella, sus hábitos de lectura y el lenguaje que usan sus maestros en la escuela. Luego, le preguntaré a <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> si quiere completar algunas actividades de lectura y números.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Esto tardará unos 20 minutos.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Si estás de acuerdo, le preguntaré a <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> si quiere participar. La participación en esta actividad es voluntaria y no se le otorgará ningún pago ni incentivo a usted ni a su hijo por responder estas preguntas. Sin embargo, estamos entrevistando a muchos niños como parte de esta encuesta, y la participación de <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span> y la de otros niños como ella nos ayudará a comprender qué tan bien están aprendiendo los niños de este país a leer y usar los números. Esto ayudará al gobierno a mejorar la educación.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Tenga en cuenta que este no es un examen escolar y que no estoy capacitado para decirle a usted ni a su hijo qué tan bien lo hizo.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Toda la información que su hijo comparta con nosotros durante la entrevista permanecerá estrictamente confidencial y anónima. Ninguna información sobre su hijo se pondrá a disposición del público. Los resultados no se compartirán con nadie, incluidos otros padres o su escuela.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Puedo hablar con <span class="REF">~~FS3A~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FL3
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL3. </span><span class="Qtxt">My name is <span class="Itxt">(your name)</span>. I would like to tell you a bit about myself.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Could you tell me a little bit about yourself?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">When the child is comfortable, continue with the verbal assent:</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Let me tell you why I am here today.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">I am from <span class="QtxtC">National Statistical Office</span>. We are talking to children like you across <span class="QtxtC">country</span> to find out how children learn to read and to use numbers.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">We have spoken to (Your mother/Name of caregiver) and (she/he) says you can participate in this activity. So, you get to decide if you want to help us. If you wish to help us, I will ask you some questions and give you some reading and number activities to do. I will explain each activity, and you can ask me questions any time.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">We hope that your participation and the participation of other children like you will help the government improve education in <span class="QtxtC">country</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">After we begin, if you do not want to answer a question or activity, or you do not want to continue, that is alright. No one will be upset.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Would you like to participate?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Mi nombre es <span class="Itxt">(tu nombre)</span>. Me gustaría contarles un poco sobre mí.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Podrías contarme un poco sobre ti?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Cuando el niño se sienta cómodo, continúa con el asentimiento verbal:</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Déjame decirte por qué estoy aquí hoy.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Soy de la <span class="QtxtC">Oficina Nacional de Estadística</span>. Estamos hablando con niños como usted en todo <span class="QtxtC">país</span> para descubrir cómo aprenden los niños a leer y utilizar los números.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Hemos hablado con (Tu madre/Nombre del cuidador) y (ella/él) dice que puedes participar en esta actividad. Entonces tú decides si quieres ayudarnos. Si deseas ayudarnos, te haré algunas preguntas y te daré algunas actividades de lectura y números para realizar. Te explicaré cada actividad y podrás hacerme preguntas en cualquier momento.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Esperamos que su participación y la de otros niños como usted ayuden al gobierno a mejorar la educación en <span class="QtxtC">país</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Después de comenzar, si no desea responder una pregunta o actividad, o no desea continuar, está bien. Nadie se enojará.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Te gustaría participar?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FL4
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">FL4. </span><span class="Itxt">Before you start with the reading and number activities, tick each box to show that:</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">- You are not alone with the child unless he/she are at least visible to an adult known to the child.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">- You have engaged the child in conversation and built rapport, e.g. using an Icebreaker.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">- The child is sat comfortably, able to use the Reading &amp; Numbers Book without difficulty while you can see which page is open.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">FL4. </span><span class="Itxt">Antes de comenzar con las actividades de lectura y números, marca cada casilla para mostrar que:</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">- No estás solo con el niño a menos que sea al menos visible para un adulto que el niño conozca.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">- Ha involucrado al niño en una conversación y ha establecido una buena relación, p. usando un rompehielos.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">- El niño está sentado cómodamente y puede utilizar el sistema de lectura y lectura. Números Reserva sin dificultad mientras puedes ver qué página está abierta.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FL6A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL6A. </span><span class="Qtxt">First, we are going to talk about reading.</span><br/></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Do you read books at home?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL6A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Primero, vamos a hablar de lectura.</span><br/></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Lees libros en casa?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FL6B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL6B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Does someone read to you at home?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL6B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien te lee en casa?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FL7
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL7. </span><span class="Qtxt">Which language do you speak most of the time at home?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe if necessary and read the listed languages.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL7. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué idioma hablas la mayor parte del tiempo en casa?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondee si es necesario y lea los idiomas enumerados.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FL9
    conditions:
      - logic: forFL9=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL9A. </span><span class="Qtxt">What language does your teachers use most of the time when teaching you in class?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe if necessary and name the listed languages.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL9A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué idioma utilizan tus profesores la mayor parte del tiempo cuando te enseñan en clase?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondee si es necesario y nombre los idiomas enumerados.</span></p>
      - logic: forFL9=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL9B. </span><span class="Qtxt">When you were in school, what language did your teachers use most of the time when teaching you in class?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe if necessary and name the listed languages.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL9B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando estabas en la escuela, ¿qué idioma usaban tus profesores la mayor parte del tiempo cuando te enseñaban en clase?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondee si es necesario y nombre los idiomas enumerados.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FL10
    conditions:
      - logic: ST1LANG=11
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I am going to give you a short story to read in <span class="QtxtC">English</span>. Would you like to start reading the story?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora les voy a dar una historia corta para leer en <span class="QtxtC">inglés</span>. ¿Quieres empezar a leer la historia?</span></p>
      - logic: ST1LANG=12
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I am going to give you a short story to read in <span class="QtxtC">French</span>. Would you like to start reading the story?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora les voy a dar una historia corta para leer en <span class="QtxtC">francés</span>. ¿Quieres empezar a leer la historia?</span></p>
      - logic: ST1LANG=13
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I am going to give you a short story to read in <span class="QtxtC">Spanish</span>. Would you like to start reading the story?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora les voy a dar un cuento corto para leer en <span class="QtxtC">español</span>. ¿Quieres empezar a leer la historia?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FL10C
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL10C. </span><span class="Qtxt">I have short stories in <span class="QtxtC">English, French, and Spanish</span>. The stories are almost the same. Would you like to try to read one of them?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL10C. </span><span class="Qtxt">Tengo cuentos en <span class="QtxtC">inglés, francés y español</span>. Las historias son casi las mismas. ¿Te gustaría intentar leer uno de ellos?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7FS.FL13
    conditions:
      - logic: ST1LANG=11
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL13. </span><span class="Itxt">Give the child the READING &amp; NUMBERS BOOK in <span class="QtxtC">English</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Open the page showing the reading practice item and say: </span><span class="Qtxt">Now we are going to do some reading.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Point to the sentence. </span><span class="Qtxt">I would like you to read this aloud. Then I may ask you a question.</span></p>
              <p><span class="ItxtC">Sam is a cat. Tina is a dog. Sam is 5 years old. Tina is 6 years old.</span></p>
          ES:
