  - name: MICS7FS.FL21BA
    conditions:
      - logic: ST1LANG=11
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL21B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I am going to ask you a few questions about what you have read.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If the child does not provide a response after a few seconds, repeat the question. If the child seems unable to provide an answer after repeating the question, mark 'No response' and say: </span><span class="Qtxt">Thank you. That is ok. We will move on.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Make sure the child can still see the passage and ask:</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt"><span class="QtxtC">What class is Moses in</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL21B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora te voy a hacer algunas preguntas sobre lo que has leído.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si el niño no responde después de unos segundos, repita la pregunta. Si el niño parece incapaz de dar una respuesta después de repetir la pregunta, marque "Sin respuesta" y diga: </span><span class="Qtxt">Gracias. Eso está bien. Seguiremos adelante.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Asegúrese de que el niño aún pueda ver el pasaje y pregunte:</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt"><span class="QtxtC">¿En qué clase está Moisés</span>?</span></p>
      - logic: ST1LANG=12
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FL21B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I am going to ask you a few questions about what you have read.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If the child does not provide a response after a few seconds, repeat the question. If the child seems unable to provide an answer after repeating the question, mark 'No response' and say: </span><span class="Qtxt">Thank you. That is ok. We will move on.</span></p>
